Show a device tree, dtbo table, or an opaque container header

Usage: android-doctor dt [OPTIONS] <INPUT>

Arguments:
  <INPUT>  dt.img, dtbo.img, logo.img, bootloader.img or a boot image

Options:
      --json      Print JSON instead of text
      --no-color  Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -h, --help      Print help
